p_8"><div class="w_12 h_12 bdr_xl bg_blue.50020 d_flex ai_center jc_center fs_2xl mb_6">🌀</div><h3 class="ff_heading fs_2xl fw_bold mb_2">The Liminal Weeb</h3><p class="fs_sm op_0.6 mb_6 lh_relaxed">Designer obsessed with liminal spaces, 90s web aesthetics, and digital decay. Finds beauty in forgotten corners of the internet.</p><div class="mb_6"><div class="fs_xs fw_semibold tt_uppercase ls_wider op_0.4 mb_2">Influences</div><div class="d_flex ai_center gap_1.5 flex-d_row flex-wrap_wrap"><span class="px_2 py_1 bdr_sm bg_blue.50010 c_blue.500 fs_xs fw_medium" q:key="Lain">Lain</span><span class="px_2 py_1 bdr_sm bg_blue.50010 c_blue.500 fs_xs fw_medium" q:key="Vaporwave">Vaporwave</span><span class="px_2 py_1 bdr_sm bg_blue.50010 c_blue.500 fs_xs fw_medium" q:key="Glitch Art">Glitch Art</span><span class="px_2 py_1 bdr_sm bg_blue.50010 c_blue.500 fs_xs fw_medium" q:key="Old Web">Old Web</span></div></div><div class="d_flex ai_center gap_4 flex-d_row fs_xs op_0.4"><span class="d_flex ai_center gap_1 flex-d_row" q:key="Cool">🎨 <span style="color:blue.400" class="fw_medium">Cool</span></span><span class="d_flex ai_center gap_1 flex-d_row" q:key="Soft">📐 <span style="color:purple.400" class="fw_medium">Soft</span></span><span class="d_flex ai_center gap_1 flex-d_row" q:key="Minimal">✨ <span style="color:cyan.400" class="fw_medium">Minimal</span></span></div></div></div></div></div></section><!--/qv--><!--qv q:id=b q:key=03nl:lG_4--><section id="how-it-works" class="py_32 pos_relative" q:key="YC_0"><div class="max-w_6xl mx_auto px_6"><div class="d_flex ai_center gap_4 flex-d_column ta_center mb_20"><h2 class="ff_heading fs_3xl md:fs_4xl lg:fs_5xl fw_bold">How Baste Works</h2><p class="fs_lg c_text-muted max-w_xl">A full pipeline from persona definition to production-ready assets.</p></div><div class="d_grid grid-tc_repeat(1,_minmax(0,_1fr)) md:grid-tc_repeat(2,_minmax(0,_1fr)) lg:grid-tc_repeat(4,_minmax(0,_1fr)) gap_6"><div class="p_6 bdr_2xl bg_rgba(255,255,255,0.02) b